I walk on the street.
But I do not see the ocean.
I do not know the way.
I see a small store.
An elderly shopkeeper sits there.
I go towards the store.
I speak to him.
"Namaste Chacha."
"Where is Marine Drive?"
"I am new here."
He smiles.
He speaks politely.
"Do not worry."
"You go straight from here."
"At the next corner, turn right."
"Then walk straight towards the sea."
I say thank you to him.
Now I go towards the right.
